Host-side unit tests for the CAM assessment device.

Run them on your computer (no ESP32 needed):

    pio test -e native

Each test_* folder is a separate Unity test program that compiles one or more
modules from src/ directly. test/host/ holds small stand-ins for the Arduino
core, WiFi, HTTPClient and TFT_eSPI so that the firmware logic runs unchanged
on a PC; the display and CSV storage are replaced with recording fakes.

  test_question_manager   question bank, shuffling, answer-key integrity
  test_input_handler      joystick mapping over the full 12-bit ADC range, debounce
  test_gemini_manager     Gemini request/response handling, sanitising, fuzzing
  test_assessment_session scoring, risk level, timeouts, slow-response flags
